BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Indivisible Northeast Indiana Discussion Group-  After the Electio
 ns: What Now?
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261115T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261115T123000
UID:4b91c819a9306303532a4a576635db70@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/Discussion%20Group_20261027174843317837.png
DESCRIPTION:**After the elections\, we may still have work to do!** Join o
 ur panel discussion featuring organizers of several local groups to learn 
 what more may need to be done to ensure vote certification and a peaceful 
 transfer of power in January 2027. Featured panelists are: - **Jim Carpent
 er** Indivisible Northeast Indiana co-founder - **Ann Johnson** Northeast 
 Indiana National Organization for Women President - **Sandra Garza** Fuerz
 a Unida Founder Opening remarks conducted by **Leonard Williams** Pro
LOCATION:Allen County Public Library - Main\, 900 Library Plz\, Meeting Ro
 om A\, Fort Wayne\, IN\, 46802
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/indivisiblenortheastindiana/event/1075650/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Central Indiana (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:New Volunteer Orientation
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261208T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261208T093000
UID:140a0597ef420ef9692c80758d117029@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/volunteer-orientation_20260402193827649019.png
DESCRIPTION:This is the next step to getting plugged into ACLU of Indiana 
 Volunteer opportunities. Register for this webinar to get trained on what 
 it means to be a volunteer with the ACLU of Indiana. Sign up for a time th
 at works for you! Once you have attended one New Volunteer Orientation you
  do not need to sign up again. These happen on a quarterly basis to get pe
 ople trained and signed up!
LOCATION:Virtual event
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/acluin/event/876028/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Central Indiana (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
